    "detailed_description": "<strong>BitBattle </strong>is a 2D multiplayer action shooter. <br>Run, Shoot, Jump and Shoot again! What counts is your reaction time and your skill.<br>Play on diffrent maps against friends or other players!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Zero Aim, 100% Bullet Hell!</strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/9812efb77cfdb62070e72cd4573f77b5.poster.avif?t=1629132868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/9812efb77cfdb62070e72cd4573f77b5.webm?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/9812efb77cfdb62070e72cd4573f77b5.mp4?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect weapons and items to make your opponent's life even worse.</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/86a5a21c842c4b7f5968bb9edc996dec.poster.avif?t=1629132868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/86a5a21c842c4b7f5968bb9edc996dec.webm?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/86a5a21c842c4b7f5968bb9edc996dec.mp4?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There is more!</strong></h2><strong>Go on a race! Shooter with races? YES! Why not.</strong><br>Race against friends or other players and win!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/f0f6dd88541908321a300eb1da81e056.poster.avif?t=1629132868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/f0f6dd88541908321a300eb1da81e056.webm?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/f0f6dd88541908321a300eb1da81e056.mp4?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiplayer up to 8 Players<br></li><li> Play offline 1vs1 on your Computer / Remote play Together<br></li><li> Skins and effects<br></li><li> Diffrent Maps<br></li><li> Diffrent Weapons<br></li><li> Diffrent Items <br></li><li> Diffrent Game Modes</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/db33117b5760374d426390616369146e.poster.avif?t=1629132868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/db33117b5760374d426390616369146e.webm?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282610/extras/db33117b5760374d426390616369146e.mp4?t=1629132868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
